structure** — declared L-1 bidder for a **Rs 78.09 crore tender** issued by the office of the Chief Engineer, Pump Storage Project Department, West Bengal _(~15.8% of mcap)_.","**Viviana Power Tech** — receives bid confirmation as the **L1 successful bidder** for an MGVCL MVCC overhead conductor and underground networking contract worth **Rs 77.79 crore** _(~11.1% of mcap)_.","**Millworks Technologies** — secures multiple purchase orders for OEM assembly components from domestic and international customers worth **Rs 53.74 crore**, expanding its FY27 confirmed order book to Rs 121.88 crore _(~4.5% of mcap)_.","**Kernex Microsystems** — wins a **Rs 31.87 crore order** from the Integral Coach Factory, Chennai, to supply, install, and commission on-board equipment _(~1.0% of mcap)_.","**Aarvi Encon** — receives a service work order worth **Rs 30.63 crore** from an undisclosed domestic customer _(~13.2% of mcap)_.","**Walchandnagar Industries** — receives a **Rs 30.53 crore contract** from the Vikram Sarabhai Space Centre, ISRO, to supply booster motor casings _(~2.0% of mcap)_.","**ITCONS E-Solutions** — bags a **Rs 13.68 crore contract** from South Western Railway, Indian Railways, for execution over a specified timeline _(~5.0% of mcap)_."],"other_notable":["**Advanced Enzyme Technologies** — initiates a buyback of its equity shares from the open market through the stock exchanges."]},"unlocks":[{"company":"Goodluck India Ltd","date":"2026-08-20","days":0,"detail":"BUY BY 20-08-2026 · record date 21-08-2026 · 2:1 bonus","ex_date":"2026-08-21","mcap":4763.4,"pct":null,"shares":0,"symbol":"GOODLUCK","type":"BONUS","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/e5449e6a-ea00-43f1-be23-547f06c9ebf0.pdf"},{"company":"SG FINSERVE LIMITED","date":"2026-08-20","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"15064","mcap":3853.1,"pct":6.56,"pct_of":"equity","shares":3925000,"src":"BSE","symbol":"SGFIN","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://ww